# .clinerules — installbeliefs.com

> **Provenance:** Created 2026-10-11 as part of the from-scratch project setup
> approved for the site/v1-review run. Hard rules and decision rules below are
> taken from the task instructions for that run. The banned-word list was NOT
> supplied with the task (none exists in the original materials) — the list
> below was written by Cline so the plain-language pass has something concrete
> to check against. If a client-provided list ever arrives, it overrides this one.

## Source of truth

- `PROJECT_BRIEF.md` is the source of truth. If the brief and the code
  disagree, follow the brief and log the change.
- Never guess the contents of PROJECT_BRIEF.md if it is missing — stop and
  report instead.

## Hard rules (never break these)

1. The hero line must read exactly: "We install beliefs in your market."
2. Do not invent client names, metrics, testimonials, logos, team members, or
   prices. Keep every bracketed placeholder as written.
3. No frameworks, build tools, npm packages, analytics, tracking scripts, or
   third-party embeds.
4. Do not delete or rename any file.
5. Only edit index.html, contact.html, styles.css, and script.js, plus
   CHANGELOG.md. Do not edit PROJECT_BRIEF.md, .clinerules, PRICING_MODEL.md,
   or CLINE_TASKS.md.
6. Do not expand scope: no new pages, sections, services, or pricing on the site.
7. Never force push. Never rewrite history. Never commit secrets or credentials.

## Decision rules

- Brief vs. code disagreement → follow the brief, log the change.
- Banned buzzword found → replace with plain language that keeps the same
  meaning; log old and new text.
- A fix needs more than about 15 lines of CSS → don't make it; log it as an issue.
- Unsure whether something is a bug or a preference → leave it alone, log it as
  a suggestion.

## Banned-word list (plain-language pass)

leverage · seamless · cutting-edge · empower · unlock · revolutionize ·
game-changing · game-changer · best-in-class · world-class · next-level ·
disruptive · synergy · robust · holistic · elevate · supercharge · transformative ·
visionary · unrivaled · unparalleled · sky's the limit · 10x · disruptive ·
delve · dive deep · unleash · harness · amplify · journey · landscape · ecosystem ·
synergize · paradigm · mission-critical · state-of-the-art · groundbreaking

Rewrite any match in visible copy with plain wording that keeps the same
meaning, and log before/after in CHANGELOG.md.

## Git

- Work only on branch `site/v1-review`. Commit format: `step N: <short description>`.
- Push with `git push -u origin site/v1-review`. Never push to main, never
  force push, never rewrite history.